21:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Mongo"}],": ",["$","code",null,{"children":"forge-store/tests/mongo_runner/"}]," downloads and starts a\nreal ",["$","code",null,{"children":"mongod"}],". This is why the store crate's Bazel timeout is ",["$","code",null,{"children":"moderate"}],"\nrather than ",["$","code",null,{"children":"short"}],", and why that suite needs network on a cold cache."]}]
