29:["$","p",null,{"children":["The ",["$","code",null,{"children":"result"}]," symlink contains an HTML report. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"No coverage\nthreshold gate"}],"; no PR is blocked on a percentage. Coverage is a tool for\nfinding untested paths, not a target to hit."]}]
